Wall.description:
How strongly a limit holds. `hard` is enforced by the edge outside the machine container and
cannot be bypassed from inside. `soft` is enforced by the daemon inside the machine container;
a root agent can bypass it.

servers.description:
TCP on port 7700. Loopback inside the machine container serves tools and interfaces there;
the inner network address serves the web door in the edge service. The daemon refuses every
other address.
